 een from Paris\, FR.\nThe Moon is -1° up · daylight\, Sun +36°.\nTimes 
 for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon'
 s edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=48.8534&lon=2.3488
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=48.8534&lon=2.3488
